<title>FINLAND: TT TIETO BUYS SWEDISH SYSTEMS COMPANY.</title>
<headline>TT TIETO BUYS SWEDISH SYSTEMS COMPANY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish information technology group TT Tieto Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had bought Swedish personnel administration systems group Habo Data AB for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The privately-owned company is based in Jonkoping and employs eight people. Its net sales are four million Swedish crowns, TT Tieto said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
